--- 1. secrets
PASS K1 the Brevo key is stored ENCRYPTED, not in clear
PASS K2 the header profile is stored encrypted: neither header value is in the database in clear
PASS K3 saving a new key checks it at once (GET /v3/account with the api-key header) and says so
PASS K4 the profile save says how many headers are valid (2: Host, Content-Type and the line without a colon are refused)
PASS K5 the options page never shows the key or the header values again (only "set")
PASS K6 saving something else keeps both secrets untouched (empty = keep)
PASS K7 a key Brevo refuses is saved with a clear warning (HTTP 401), not silently
PASS K8 a profile may carry the endpoint ("URL:" line) so a secret hook address never needs to be in the page
PASS K9 the public markup of "brevo1" holds no key and no header value
PASS K9 the public markup of "hookprof" holds no key and no header value
PASS K9 the public markup of "hookprof_url" holds no key and no header value
PASS K9 the public markup of "paidhook" holds no key and no header value
PASS K10 the signed token carries only the profile NAME
--- 2. webhook profiles
PASS W1 the element webhook carries the profile headers (Authorization, X-Api-Key)
PASS W2 forbidden header lines are ignored: Host stays the real host, Content-Type stays JSON
PASS W3 the payload names the event: booking.created
PASS W4 an element with its OWN address and no profile never gets the plugin-wide profile (no credentials sent to another endpoint)
PASS W5 the plugin-wide webhook uses the plugin-wide profile
PASS W6 a profile with a "URL:" line is the endpoint when the element has none
PASS W7 an unknown profile name sends NOTHING (no fall back), says so in the log and the staff is told
PASS W8 no header value ever reaches the log
--- 3. webhook events
PASS V0 hook_cfg is stored on the booking with the profile NAME only
PASS V1 RESCHEDULED: the webhook hears booking.rescheduled with the new and the previous slot, with the profile headers
PASS V2 CANCELLED by the customer: booking.cancelled, cancelled_by customer, status cancelled
PASS V3 CANCELLED by the staff from the admin: booking.cancelled, cancelled_by staff
PASS V4a an unpaid hold is NOT announced to the webhook
PASS V4 PAID: booking.paid with status confirmed, payment_status paid and the amount
PASS V5 EXPIRED: the hold that lapsed is announced as booking.expired
PASS V5b EXPIRED also when Stripe says the session expired
PASS V6 the receiver is down (500): the reschedule still works for the customer and the event waits in the outbox
PASS V6b still inside the backoff: nothing is re-sent yet
PASS V6c once the receiver is back the scheduled task delivers it, once, and empties the outbox
PASS V7 a receiver that REFUSES (401) is not retried forever: nothing in the outbox, the log says it
--- 4. confirm and tell the customer
PASS M1 a pending booking shows the button "Confirm and tell the customer" on its detail page
PASS M2 a booking that is already confirmed does not show it
PASS M3 the click confirms the booking and sends the customer the "Appointment confirmed" email (with the .ics)
PASS M3b the admin is told in a clear line
PASS M4 a second click does nothing: no second email, the admin is told it was not waiting
PASS M5 the webhook hears booking.confirmed (confirmed_by staff)
--- 5. staff email "moved"
PASS S1 the staff email of a reschedule says "Appointment moved" (not "New booking")
PASS S2 ...with the new slot in the subject and the previous one in the text
PASS S3 a NEW booking has the "New Event" subject
--- 6. Brevo
PASS B1 a booking on an element set to "every booking" creates the contact (POST /v3/contacts, api-key header)
PASS B2 NOME = first word, COGNOME = the rest, SMS in E.164 (spaces removed)
PASS B3 extra attributes come from the form answers (CITTA=Citta, progetto = progetto, case and spaces forgiven)
PASS B4 without the newsletter tick the contact is saved WITHOUT any list (no subscription without consent)
PASS B4b ...and the call carries no listIds and no updateEnabled (never overwrites an existing contact)
PASS B5 the step is recorded and the booking is done
PASS B6 the customer sees nothing about Brevo
PASS B7 newsletter tick on a "newsletter only" element with lists 7 and 12: the subscription goes THROUGH double opt-in (lists 7 and 12, NOME only), no direct contact
PASS B8 the same email again (anyone can type any email): the existing contact is left EXACTLY as it was, no overwrite, no error
PASS B9 no newsletter tick on a "newsletter only" element: Brevo is not called at all
PASS B10 phone "333 777 0002" -> +393337770002
PASS B10 phone "0039 333 777 0003" -> +393337770003
PASS B10 phone "non e un numero" -> None
PASS B10 phone "+39 12" -> None
PASS B10 phone "" -> None
PASS B10 phone "+44 7911 123456" -> +447911123456
PASS B11 double opt-in with the newsletter tick: POST doubleOptinConfirmation (template 5, list 12, redirect) and NO direct contact creation
PASS B12 double opt-in element without the tick: nothing is sent to Brevo (no consent)
PASS B13 double opt-in turned on WITHOUT a template: no contact is added without consent, the staff is told, the booking works
PASS B14 Brevo down (500): the booking is confirmed, the customer email and the Google event are done
PASS B15 ...and only the Brevo step is left to retry (fx_state retry)
PASS B16 Brevo back: the scheduled task adds the contact, the booking is done, NOTHING is sent twice (mails, events)
PASS B17 Brevo answers 429 (rate limit): retried, not an error
PASS B18 an attribute Brevo does not know (400): the booking works, nothing is shown to the customer
PASS B19 ...the step ends as "error" (a retry could not fix it), the booking is done, no retry loop
PASS B20 ...the log explains it with Brevo's reason, without the customer email or any key
PASS B21 ...and the staff gets one email about it, in the element recipient or the plugin address, without the key
PASS B22 the next task run does not call Brevo again for it
PASS B23 a key Brevo refuses (401): booking works, error step, log says the key is refused, staff mailed
PASS B24 Brevo switched on for the element but no key in the plugin options: booking works, clear log line, staff mailed

